{
  "flowchart TB\n    B[浏览器或 API 客户端] -->|HTTPS| RP[Caddy 或其他反向代理]\n    RP -->|页面与 API| WEB[Web 进程：自定义 Node + Next.js]\n    RP -->|SSH / RDP WebSocket| GW[独立 WebSocket 网关]\n    WEB <--> DB[(PostgreSQL)]\n    WORKER[独立 Worker 进程] <--> DB\n    GW <--> DB\n    WEB --> STORE[LOCAL / SFTP / WebDAV 存储]\n    WEB --> AI[AI 提供商]\n    WEB --> DOCKER[本机或远端 Docker]\n    WORKER --> LINUX[Linux VPS / SSH]\n    WORKER --> STORE\n    WORKER --> EXT[通知 / S3 备份 / 外部集成]\n    GW -->|SSH| LINUX\n    GW -->|Guacamole 协议| GUACD[回环网关 guacd]\n    GUACD -->|RDP| WINDOWS[Windows 节点]\n    AGENT[Linux / Windows Agent] -->|主动 HTTPS 轮询| WEB\n    B -. 短时文件链接 .-> DIRECT[目标机文件网关]": "<figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption>系统总体架构：进程边界与主要调用对象</figcaption><div class=\"diagram-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1000 745\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"arch-title\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title id=\"arch-title\">VControlHub 三进程架构、数据库与主要调用对象</title><defs><marker id=\"arch-arrow\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z\" fill=\"#63819e\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"141\" stroke=\"#63819e\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><text x=\"515\" y=\"117\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\">HTTPS</text><line x1=\"630\" y1=\"49\" x2=\"695\" y2=\"49\" stroke=\"#63819e\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><text x=\"672\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">短时文件链接</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"202\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#63819e\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><text x=\"183\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">主动 HTTPS 轮询</text><line x1=\"417\" y1=\"202\" x2=\"256\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#63819e\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">页面 / API</text><line x1=\"583\" y1=\"202\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#63819e\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><text x=\"708\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">SSH / RDP WebSocket</text><line x1=\"246\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"399\" y2=\"415\" stroke=\"#63819e\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\" marker-start=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"409\" stroke=\"#63819e\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\" marker-start=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"754\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"602\" y2=\"415\" stroke=\"#63819e\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\" marker-start=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"370\" y=\"18\" width=\"260\" height=\"62\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e5f3ee\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"55.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">浏览器 / API 客户端</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"18\" width=\"260\" height=\"62\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"43.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">目标机文件网关</text><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"67.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">按节点策略提供文件直连</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"141\" width=\"260\" height=\"62\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"166.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">Linux / Windows Agent</text><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"190.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">心跳、采样与命令领取</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"141\" width=\"260\" height=\"62\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"166.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">HTTPS 反向代理</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"190.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">Caddy 或其他反代</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"260\" width=\"260\" height=\"70\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"289.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">Web 进程</text><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"313.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">自定义 Node + Next.js</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"260\" width=\"260\" height=\"70\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"289.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">Worker 进程</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"313.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">后台任务、调度与采样</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"260\" width=\"260\" height=\"70\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"289.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">WebSocket 网关</text><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"313.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">SSH / RDP 实时连接</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"415\" width=\"260\" height=\"74\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff3d9\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"446.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">PostgreSQL</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"470.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">业务状态、Job、租约与事件</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"553\" width=\"260\" height=\"142\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"594.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">Web 主要调用对象</text><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"618.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">LOCAL / SFTP / WebDAV</text><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"642.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">AI 提供商</text><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"666.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">本机或远端 Docker</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"553\" width=\"260\" height=\"142\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"594.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">Worker 主要调用对象</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"618.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">Linux VPS / SSH、存储</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"642.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">通知 / S3 / 外部集成</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"666.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">Agent 任务经 Web 领取</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"553\" width=\"260\" height=\"142\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"594.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">网关的目标链路</text><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"618.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">SSH → 目标 OpenSSH</text><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"642.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">Guacamole → guacd</text><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"666.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\">guacd → Windows RDP</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#52677c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\">实线表示主要通信；底部按进程列出主要调用对象。</text></svg></div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看 Mermaid 源码</summary><pre><code>flowchart TB\n    B[浏览器或 API 客户端] --&gt;|HTTPS| RP[Caddy 或其他反向代理]\n    RP --&gt;|页面与 API| WEB[Web 进程：自定义 Node + Next.js]\n    RP --&gt;|SSH / RDP WebSocket| GW[独立 WebSocket 网关]\n    WEB &lt;--&gt; DB[(PostgreSQL)]\n    WORKER[独立 Worker 进程] &lt;--&gt; DB\n    GW &lt;--&gt; DB\n    WEB --&gt; STORE[LOCAL / SFTP / WebDAV 存储]\n    WEB --&gt; AI[AI 提供商]\n    WEB --&gt; DOCKER[本机或远端 Docker]\n    WORKER --&gt; LINUX[Linux VPS / SSH]\n    WORKER --&gt; STORE\n    WORKER --&gt; EXT[通知 / S3 备份 / 外部集成]\n    GW --&gt;|SSH| LINUX\n    GW --&gt;|Guacamole 协议| GUACD[回环网关 guacd]\n    GUACD --&gt;|RDP| WINDOWS[Windows 节点]\n    AGENT[Linux / Windows Agent] --&gt;|主动 HTTPS 轮询| WEB\n    B -. 短时文件链接 .-&gt; DIRECT[目标机文件网关]\n</code></pre></details></figure>",
  "sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant W as Web/API\n    participant D as PostgreSQL\n    participant A as 审批人\n    participant K as Worker\n    participant S as 目标服务器\n    U->>W: 提交命令、目标和原因\n    W->>D: 保存命令请求及目标\n    alt 需要审批\n        A->>W: 批准或拒绝\n        W->>D: 保存审批结果\n    end\n    W->>D: 为获准请求创建 Job\n    K->>D: 认领任务并取得租约\n    K->>D: 重新检查身份、团队及资源\n    K->>S: 通过 SSH 或 Agent 执行\n    K->>D: 写心跳、输出和目标状态\n    S-->>K: 退出状态或错误\n    K->>D: 写任务结果、事件、审计和通知\n    U->>W: 查看审批或任务中心\n    W->>D: 读取持久化结果\n    W-->>U: 展示完成、失败或待处理原因": "<figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption>命令执行时序：提交、审批、执行与结果</figcaption><div class=\"diagram-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1160 910\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"sequence-title\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title id=\"sequence-title\">从提交命令、审批到 Worker 执行及结果查询的时序</title><defs><marker id=\"seq-arrow\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z\" fill=\"#537699\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"880\" stroke=\"#d4dee8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"16\" width=\"156\" height=\"54\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"49.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">用户</text><line x1=\"285\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"285\" y2=\"880\" stroke=\"#d4dee8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><rect x=\"207\" y=\"16\" width=\"156\" height=\"54\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"285.0\" y=\"49.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">Web / API</text><line x1=\"480\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"880\" stroke=\"#d4dee8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><rect x=\"402\" y=\"16\" width=\"156\" height=\"54\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"480.0\" y=\"49.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">PostgreSQL</text><line x1=\"675\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"675\" y2=\"880\" stroke=\"#d4dee8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><rect x=\"597\" y=\"16\" width=\"156\" height=\"54\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"675.0\" y=\"49.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">审批人</text><line x1=\"870\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"870\" y2=\"880\" stroke=\"#d4dee8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><rect x=\"792\" y=\"16\" width=\"156\" height=\"54\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"870.0\" y=\"49.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">Worker</text><line x1=\"1065\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"1065\" y2=\"880\" stroke=\"#d4dee8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><rect x=\"987\" y=\"16\" width=\"156\" height=\"54\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f6fc\" stroke=\"#becfdd\"/><text x=\"1065.0\" y=\"49.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">目标服务器</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"123\" x2=\"285\" y2=\"123\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"187.5\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">1. 提交命令、目标和原因</text><line x1=\"285\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"178\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"382.5\" y=\"169\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">2. 保存命令请求及目标</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"200\" width=\"555\" height=\"101\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff6df\" stroke=\"#e7d2a0\"/><text x=\"738\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#876316\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\">需要审批时</text><line x1=\"675\" y1=\"233\" x2=\"285\" y2=\"233\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"480.0\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">3. 批准或拒绝</text><line x1=\"285\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"382.5\" y=\"279\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">4. 保存审批结果</text><line x1=\"285\" y1=\"343\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"343\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"382.5\" y=\"334\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">5. 为获准请求创建 Job</text><line x1=\"870\" y1=\"398\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"398\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"675.0\" y=\"389\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">6. 认领任务并取得租约</text><line x1=\"870\" y1=\"453\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"453\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"675.0\" y=\"444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">7. 重新检查身份、团队及资源</text><line x1=\"870\" y1=\"508\" x2=\"1065\" y2=\"508\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"967.5\" y=\"499\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">8. 通过 SSH 或 Agent 执行</text><line x1=\"870\" y1=\"563\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"563\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"675.0\" y=\"554\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">9. 写心跳、输出和目标状态</text><line x1=\"1065\" y1=\"618\" x2=\"870\" y2=\"618\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"967.5\" y=\"609\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">10. 退出状态或错误</text><line x1=\"870\" y1=\"673\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"673\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"675.0\" y=\"664\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">11. 写任务结果、事件、审计和通知</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"728\" x2=\"285\" y2=\"728\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"187.5\" y=\"719\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">12. 查看审批或任务中心</text><line x1=\"285\" y1=\"783\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"783\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\"/><text x=\"382.5\" y=\"774\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">13. 读取持久化结果</text><line x1=\"285\" y1=\"838\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"838\" stroke=\"#537699\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#seq-arrow)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"187.5\" y=\"829\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23354b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\">14. 展示完成、失败或待处理原因</text></svg></div><details class=\"diagram-source\"><summary>查看 Mermaid 源码</summary><pre><code>sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant W as Web/API\n    participant D as PostgreSQL\n    participant A as 审批人\n    participant K as Worker\n    participant S as 目标服务器\n    U-&gt;&gt;W: 提交命令、目标和原因\n    W-&gt;&gt;D: 保存命令请求及目标\n    alt 需要审批\n        A-&gt;&gt;W: 批准或拒绝\n        W-&gt;&gt;D: 保存审批结果\n    end\n    W-&gt;&gt;D: 为获准请求创建 Job\n    K-&gt;&gt;D: 认领任务并取得租约\n    K-&gt;&gt;D: 重新检查身份、团队及资源\n    K-&gt;&gt;S: 通过 SSH 或 Agent 执行\n    K-&gt;&gt;D: 写心跳、输出和目标状态\n    S--&gt;&gt;K: 退出状态或错误\n    K-&gt;&gt;D: 写任务结果、事件、审计和通知\n    U-&gt;&gt;W: 查看审批或任务中心\n    W-&gt;&gt;D: 读取持久化结果\n    W--&gt;&gt;U: 展示完成、失败或待处理原因\n</code></pre></details></figure>"
